30,2,1,talk,May,,"It seems a couple of people are using the room way more than others, and the fridge cleaning is a one-person job.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The wall is basically paper; we can hear everything. Plus, people are eating at their desks and leaving crumbs everywhere.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Walking for lunch takes nearly half an hour. Interestingly, the empty store room has had zero facilities issues.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"We've spent 68,000 yen on outside rentals for tiny groups! Also, a meeting setup is more expensive than a kitchen.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"We're barely talking unless it's by the printer, and the last serious talk happened right in front of everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if people are eating at desks, maybe a kitchen is the answer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, but if it's a kitchen, will the smell and noise just get worse for those of us sitting right there?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Servas,,"A kitchen would save us that long walk for lunch, which is a significant waste of our vitality.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"But the meeting room fit-out is 141,000 yen. That's a lot more than the kitchen's 96,000.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, but we're already paying for outside rooms. Maybe spending it once on a meeting space saves money later?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, a meeting space is great, but who manages the booking? I don't want to be the only one cleaning it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If it's a quiet room, the noise issue is solved. But that doesn't help the crumbs at the desks.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A quiet room is peaceful, but it doesn't address the inefficiency of our lunch hour.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"If we keep renting outside, we'll just keep paying those hourly invoices. We need a permanent solution.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We need a place for those awkward conversations. A quiet room is for sitting alone; we need a meeting space.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,May,,"I'm torn. A kitchen is practical, but a meeting space is professional.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I just want the noise and the crumbs gone from my immediate workspace.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us consider the balance of time and peace.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I just want us to stop wasting money on those outside hires.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's make sure we don't stay strangers in our own office.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
