55,3,1,talk,May,,"The options are an Open Kitchen, a Quiet Room, or a Meeting Space. I think the kitchen solves the desk mess.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"A Quiet Room would be the best for my sanity, but a Meeting Space might stop the public arguments.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Servas,,The Open Kitchen would reclaim our time from those long walks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"Meeting Space stops the outside hire costs, but the Kitchen is cheaper to install.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Meeting Space is the only one that fixes our communication problem.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, do you really think a bookable room will make us talk more?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, at least it's not a kitchen where people will be shouting over a microwave.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Servas,,"A Quiet Room is a luxury, but perhaps not a necessity for the group's health.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, if we go with the kitchen, who signs for the maintenance?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, the meeting space has a shared calendar. It's more organized.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,May,,I'll go with the kitchen. It's the most used type of space anyway.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I can't support the kitchen. I vote for the Quiet Room.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Servas,,I agree with May. The time saved on lunch is too valuable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I'll vote for the Meeting Space to stop those hourly invoices.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"Meeting Space, definitely. We need the privacy.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
